ted deadline; StatusBar shows a message&lt;br&gt;• [duplicate deadline] the user is asked whether to merge" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1320" width="1100" height="136" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>